# Prompt Styling

Write like a real engineer prompting a terminal agent — vary style between tasks.

## Six Principles

Concise · Well specified · Interesting · No hints · Unique · Absolute paths

## Avoid

- "You are an expert programmer..."
- Step-by-step walkthroughs with exact values
- Hints / detection guidance sections
- Heavy markdown API spec dumps
- Emojis, canary strings, GPT verbosity
- Offloading instructions into spec.md/README loophole

## Good Tone

"The source data is in `/data/input.csv`. Write results to `/output/report.json`."

See `docs/guidelines/prompt-styling.md`.
